:null}],"hint":"What times 2 makes 18?","steps":"1. Rule: the factors of a number divide into it exactly. Find them in pairs that multiply to the number, starting with 1.<br>2. 18 ÷ 2 = 9, so 2 × 9<br>3. 18 ÷ 3 = 6, so 3 × 6"}]}